<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25 lower.  Trading moderately active. Top $58.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    58.25-58.75</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    57.75-58.25</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    56.75-57.75</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    55.75-56.75</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    54.00-55.75</p>
<p>	    300-320 lbs    52.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs steady; 450-550 lbs steady; 550-650 lbs steady to 0.50 lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.75-46.00</p>
<p>	    450-550 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>	    550-650 lbs    47.50-48.00</p>
</text>
